From 92a21ba7e47f314084fd4d93307885ca5924cc2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:25:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD Vim visual yanks in terminal panes for clipboard
 copying

Terminal command mode supports character, line, and block selections in both panes. Yanking copies the focused pane text through OSC52 so terminal users can copy chat or agent-list content without leaving the modal UI.
---
